<div class="bar" role="img" aria-label="5 identical, 17 kept two or more, 7 kept one, 0 all new"><i style="flex:5;background:var(--gold)"></i><i style="flex:17;background:var(--purple)"></i><i style="flex:7;background:var(--bad)"></i></div>
<div class="legend"><span style="--c:var(--gold)">5 identical</span><span style="--c:var(--purple)">17 kept 2+</span><span style="--c:var(--bad)">7 kept only 1</span><span style="--c:#444">0 all new</span></div>
<p class="note" style="margin-top:12px">Played across teams: 13 teams with 2 matches, 5 with 3, 2 with 4. Only 7 teams had 3+ matches in 2+ countries, so only 7 could ever be checked for the +6.</p>
</section>

<section>
